{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4711-8899-aabbccddeeff",
    "name": "API Products",
    "description": "Collection completa do projeto api-products: cobre TODOS os endpoints da API. Autenticacao (CSRF Cookie, Register, Get User, Logout, Login, Create Token), CRUD de Categorias (List/Create/Show/Update/Delete) e CRUD de Produtos com filtros (List/Create/Show/Update/Delete). Todos os endpoints sao testaveis por aqui.\n\nAUTENTICACAO: as rotas protegidas aceitam os dois modos ao mesmo tempo:\n- SPA (cookie/sessao): rode '1. CSRF Cookie' + '2. Register' (ou '5. Login'). Usa Referer/Origin + X-XSRF-TOKEN.\n- Bearer token: rode '6. Create Token'. Ela usa HTTP Basic ({{user_email}}:{{user_password}}) contra POST /api/token/create (rota publica, nao precisa de sessao/CSRF) e o Test salva a resposta em {{api_token}}. A collection tem auth Bearer {{api_token}} no nivel raiz, entao TODAS as requests enviam Authorization: Bearer automaticamente quando o token estiver preenchido.\n\nO pre-request no nivel da collection le o cookie XSRF-TOKEN e injeta em {{xsrf_token}}, usado no header X-XSRF-TOKEN.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{api_token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://projeto.site" },
    { "key": "user_name", "value": "Test User" },
    { "key": "user_email", "value": "test@example.com" },
    { "key": "user_password", "value": "password" },
    { "key": "xsrf_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "api_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "category_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "product_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Le o cookie XSRF-TOKEN do jar e injeta em {{xsrf_token}} antes de cada request.",
          "try {",
          "  const jar = pm.cookies.jar();",
          "  jar.get(pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url'), 'XSRF-TOKEN', (err, value) => {",
          "    if (!err && value) {",
          "      pm.collectionVariables.set('xsrf_token', decodeURIComponent(value));",
          "    }",
          "  });",
          "} catch (e) { /* jar indisponivel: rode a request 'CSRF Cookie' primeiro */ }"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. CSRF Cookie",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie",
        "description": "Inicializa a sessao e seta os cookies XSRF-TOKEN e de sessao. Rode isto primeiro. O script de Test captura o XSRF-TOKEN e injeta em {{xsrf_token}} automaticamente."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
              "",
              "function saveXsrf(value) {",
              "  const token = decodeURIComponent(value);",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('xsrf_token', token);",
              "  console.log('XSRF token setado:', token);",
              "}",
              "",
              "let xsrf = null;",
              "try { xsrf = pm.cookies.get('XSRF-TOKEN'); } catch (e) { /* fora do escopo */ }",
              "",
              "if (xsrf) {",
              "  saveXsrf(xsrf);",
              "} else {",
              "  try {",
              "    const jar = pm.cookies.jar();",
              "    jar.get(pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url'), 'XSRF-TOKEN', (err, value) => {",
              "      if (!err && value) { saveXsrf(value); }",
              "      else { console.warn('Nao consegui ler XSRF-TOKEN. Adicione o dominio de {{base_url}} na allowlist de cookies do Postman.'); }",
              "    });",
              "  } catch (e) {",
              "    console.warn('Cookie jar indisponivel. Adicione o dominio de {{base_url}} na allowlist de cookies do Postman.');",
              "  }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Register",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Email unico apenas para este Register (escopo de request), sem sobrescrever {{user_email}}.",
              "pm.variables.set('register_email', 'user_' + Date.now() + '@example.com');"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 204 (registrado e autenticado)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Referer", "value": "{{base_url}}" },
          { "key": "Origin", "value": "{{base_url}}" },
          { "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN", "value": "{{xsrf_token}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{user_name}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{register_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{user_password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{user_password}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": "{{base_url}}/register"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Get User (autenticado)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Referer", "value": "{{base_url}}" },
          { "key": "Origin", "value": "{{base_url}}" }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/user",
        "description": "Retorna o usuario logado. Funciona via sessao (cookie) ou via Bearer token (se {{api_token}} preenchido)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Tem email', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('email'));"
            ]
